            <abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>The rail stations in California existing passenger rail system. All station information was compiled from Amtrak Operating Timetable 45 and commuter rail websites for Metrolink, ACE, Caltrain, and Coaster.</gco:CharacterString>
            </abstract>
            <purpose>
                <gco:CharacterString>This point feature class represents all passenger and commuter rail stops, and Amtrak thruway bus stops, and identifies intermodal transit stops throughout the state.</gco:CharacterString>
            </purpose>
